---@description "미니게임의 시작 비용 검증과 결과 정산을 유형별로 처리"
@Logic
script MiniGameSettlementRule extends Logic

	property string AMOUNT_MODE_PLAYER_SELECTED = "PlayerSelected"
	property string AMOUNT_MODE_FIXED = "Fixed"
	property string CURRENCY_GROUP_MESO = "groupMeso"
	property string CURRENCY_NIGHT_MARKET_COIN = "nightMarketCoin"
	property string STATUS_VALIDATED = "validated"
	property string STATUS_SETTLED = "settled"
	property string STATUS_CANCELLED = "cancelled"

	method boolean Supports(integer settlementType)
		-- 공통 정산 규칙이 인식하는 유형 여부 확인
		return _EMiniGameSettlementType:IsValid(settlementType)
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method any CreateState(any preset, integer betAmount, string userId, boolean isBettingRequest)
		-- 프리셋 정산 규칙과 서버 권위 잔액을 기준으로 세션 정산 상태 생성
		if preset == nil then
			return nil
		end

		local rule = preset.settlementRule or {}
		local settlementType = rule.type or _EMiniGameSettlementType.None
		if self:Supports(settlementType) == false then
			return nil
		end

		local requiresBet = _EMiniGameSettlementType:IsBetting(settlementType)
		if requiresBet ~= isBettingRequest then
			log_warning("[MiniGameSettlementRule] start request mismatch type="
				.. _EMiniGameSettlementType:ToName(settlementType))
			return nil
		end

		if settlementType == _EMiniGameSettlementType.None then
			return {
				type = settlementType,
				status = self.STATUS_VALIDATED,
				amount = 0,
				inputCurrency = "",
				outputCurrency = ""
			}
		end

		if _ProgressManager:CanUseProgress(userId) == false then
			return nil
		end

		local amount = self:ResolveAmount(rule, betAmount)
		if self:IsValidAmount(rule, amount) == false then
			log_warning("[MiniGameSettlementRule] invalid amount type=" .. _EMiniGameSettlementType:ToName(settlementType)
				.. " amount=" .. tostring(amount))
			return nil
		end

		local progress = _ProgressManager:ServerGetProgress()
		if progress == nil then
			return nil
		end

		local inputCurrency = rule.inputCurrency or ""
		local balance = 0
		if inputCurrency == self.CURRENCY_GROUP_MESO then
			local currentGroupMeso = math.floor(progress.groupMeso or 0)
			balance = currentGroupMeso
			if amount > currentGroupMeso then
				log_warning("[MiniGameSettlementRule] insufficient groupMeso user=" .. tostring(userId)
					.. " amount=" .. tostring(amount)
					.. " balance=" .. tostring(currentGroupMeso))
				return nil
			end
		end

		return {
			type = settlementType,
			status = self.STATUS_VALIDATED,
			amount = amount,
			inputCurrency = inputCurrency,
			outputCurrency = rule.outputCurrency or "",
			creditAmount = 0,
			balance = balance
		}
	end

	method integer ResolveAmount(any rule, integer betAmount)
		-- 고정 비용과 사용자 선택 판돈을 공통 금액으로 변환
		if rule.amountMode == self.AMOUNT_MODE_FIXED then
			return math.floor(rule.amount or 0)
		end

		return math.floor(betAmount or 0)
	end

	method boolean IsValidAmount(any rule, integer amount)
		-- 최소값과 증가 단위를 기준으로 정산 금액 검증
		if rule == nil or amount == nil then
			return false
		end

		local minAmount = math.floor(rule.min or 0)
		local amountStep = math.floor(rule.step or 1)
		if amount < minAmount or amountStep <= 0 then
			return false
		end

		return (amount - minAmount) % amountStep == 0
	end

	@ExecSpace("ServerOnly")
	method boolean TrySettle(any settlementState, integer creditAmount, string userId)
		-- 검증된 정산 상태를 결과 금액으로 한 번만 반영
		if settlementState == nil or settlementState.status ~= self.STATUS_VALIDATED then
			return false
		end

		if creditAmount == nil or creditAmount < 0 then
			return false
		end

		if settlementState.type ~= _EMiniGameSettlementType.MesoBet then
			log_warning("[MiniGameSettlementRule] settlement not implemented type="
				.. _EMiniGameSettlementType:ToName(settlementState.type))
			return false
		end

		local isApplied = _ProgressManager:TryApplyGroupMesoTransaction(
			settlementState.amount,
			creditAmount,
			userId
		)
		if isApplied == false then
			return false
		end

		settlementState.creditAmount = creditAmount
		settlementState.status = self.STATUS_SETTLED
		return true
	end

	method void Cancel(any settlementState)
		-- 미정산 상태를 자산 변동 없이 취소
		if settlementState == nil or settlementState.status ~= self.STATUS_VALIDATED then
			return
		end

		settlementState.status = self.STATUS_CANCELLED
	end

end
